# invincible_huba authoring plan (records fixtures/padlogs/invincible_huba.padlog, --stop-at 3000, on the hub card warped to
# Jungle Bungle: tools/warp_save.py --chunk 'levels\earth\hub\huba' --place 0xFFFF; the requests become its "# test=" line):
# LOAD GAME (load_game.plan's presses anchored on the GameController states), then the Aku Aku crate on the iron crates' stack
# broken by landing on it (TEST teleport above it: the second mask, the shining one), a jump off, the crate by the river broken
# with a spin (TEST teleport: the third mask, 8 seconds of invincibility) and a run into the crab (TEST teleport beside it):
# the crab's contact takes no hit point. With "hitpoints 2" asked between the two crates the second crate's mask is only the
# shining one again and the crab's contact takes one
until-gstate 7 9000
idle 11
hold START 5
until-gstate 8 600
idle 78
hold DOWN 3
idle 47
hold CROSS 5
idle 395
hold DOWN 3
idle 97
hold CROSS 3
until-gstate 9 3000
until-gstate 12 9000
idle 60
teleport -109.9 -1.5 110.1
wait 60
jump
teleport -56.4 -1.5 77.5
wait 30
spin
wait 20
teleport -41.7 -1.0 33.0
wait 5
goto -41.7 40.0 0.3 50
wait 120
stop
